Z||000002||007DOUG||08-11-2000||09:06 AM||||Pontiac Sunfires have a lumbar option. However its a manual lumbar. You'll find a handpump under the driver's seat.<P>Maybe you could transplant the bladder.<P>I believe there are only 841 GT made with that option. Someone correct me if I'm wrong please. <P>------------------<BR>4 Indy pace Cars<BR>84 T-top<BR>84 SE<BR>86 SE V6 153K<BR>2 86 GT's<BR>86 GT 3.4 Pearl White T-top<BR>2 88 GT twins<P>However......<BR><I>"Time is my most precious and most perishable of all my possessions."</I>||||reg||12
